    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d720">

                <pb facs="0598" n="482" xml:id="pg482"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11744b.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Argentine Minister
                        </hi><anchor n="15" xml:id="d720-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 22, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith for
                    your information a copy of the address delivered by the President to Congress on
                    April 20, 1914, regarding the situation which has arisen in the dealings of the
                    United States with General Victoriano Huerta at Mexico City.</p>
                <p>The address has been cabled in its entirety to the American Chargé d’Affaires at
                    Buenos Aires for communication by him to the Government of Argentina.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d720-f1" n="15" type="source" xml:id="d720-f1-content">
                <p>The same mutatis mutandis to the diplomatic representatives of Austria-Hungary,
                    Belgium, Brazil, Chile, Denmark, France, Germany, Great Britain, Greece, Italy,
                    Netherlands, Norway, Portugal, Russia, Spain, Sweden, Switzerland, and
                    Turkey.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
